ars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2346_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"385"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-16T15:09:39-07:00","id":1297363,"title":"","content":"Okay everyone, so here's the deal: I wasn't actually able to back the lunar kickstarter due to some other financial obligations at the time. I was able to procure the character generation rules and have about 80% of what's necessary to update the tool completed. That being said, I don't have the charms:<br /> <br /> So here's what I need from you guys:<br /> <br /> 1) Ox-bodies: I know they work like the Solar Ox-Body but I need to know what health levels are granted at each level of stamina.<br /> 2) Excellencies: How do lunar's acquire excellencies? Is it similar to solars in that they automatically get them or more like the Dragon-Blooded where you get your dice adders rolled into the effects of other charms. If the later, I need to know the names of the charms that grant the excellencies so I can incorporate them into the logic on the character sheet.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1g_IC644YJoiVAm6ngqcBmsQtff2YYtd3pDbZpaOxx4o\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Character Creation Tool may be downloaded here.</a> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1086797-demac-s-exalted-character-creation-tool\" target=\"_blank\">The thread talking about the tool can be found here.</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1136654-exalted-seats-of-power\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted: Seats of Power is a homebrewed manse creation system.</a><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1oaq3wk7lJKZ022SUA4iPfGzMpmBTNXlM\" target=\"_blank\">I have a rewrite of the craft system which can be downloaded here.</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1070312-i-got-my-book-it-s-super-fancy-and-i-can-t-read-the-cover/page2\" target=\"_blank\">I like the Mesoamerican look</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2346-demac","name":"Demac","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2346_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"385"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-16T15:39:31-07:00","id":1297373,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Demac</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1086797-demac-s-exalted-character-creation-tool?p=1297363#post1297363\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1) Ox-bodies: I know they work like the Solar Ox-Body but I need to know what health levels are granted at each level of stamina.</div> </div> </div> </div> <b>Stamina 1-2:</b> \u22122x<br /> <b>Stamina 3-4: </b>\u22122x2/\u22124<br /> <b>Stamina 5:</b> \u22121/\u22122/\u22124x2<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Demac</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1086797-demac-s-exalted-character-creation-tool?p=1297363#post1297363\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">2) Excellencies: How do lunar's acquire excellencies? Is it similar to solars in that they automatically get them or more like the Dragon-Blooded where you get your dice adders rolled into the effects of other charms. If the later, I need to know the names of the charms that grant the excellencies so I can incorporate them into the logic on the character sheet.</div> </div> </div> </div> You automatically gain the Excellency of a Caste/Favoured Attribute if you have 3+ dots in it, <i>or</i> have at least one Charm. This rises to 5 dots or two Charms for non-Favoured Attributes. They are not named Charms.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-16T16:30:01-07:00","id":1297379,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The MG</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1086797-demac-s-exalted-character-creation-tool?p=1297373#post1297373\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> <b>Stamina 1-2:</b> \u22122x<br /> <b>Stamina 3-4: </b>\u22122x2/\u22124<br /> <b>Stamina 5:</b> \u22121/\u22122/\u22124x2<br /> <br /> You automatically gain the Excellency of a Caste/Favoured Attribute if you have 3+ dots in it, <i>or</i> have at least one Charm. This rises to 5 dots or two Charms for non-Favoured Attributes. They are not named Charms.<br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thank you!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-